"char_end": 306,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 21.12,
"end": 27.85,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Linear is the task management tool built for speed – designed for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 307,
"char_end": 386,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 27.85,
"end": 29.639,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 387,
"char_end": 408,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 29.639,
"end": 40.028,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we get into the topic, Rafael Vasconcelos was on the show to discuss how drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 409,
"char_end": 545,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 40.028,
"end": 40.858,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 561,
"char_end": 574,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 40.858,
"end": 44.243,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to discuss today.",
"char_start": 575,
"char_end": 628,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 44.243,
"end": 51.735,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point out something – Rafael Vasconcelos mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 646,
"char_end": 744,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.735,
"end": 53.937,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 745,
"char_end": 772,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 53.937,
"end": 58.016,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 773,
"char_end": 823,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 58.016,
"end": 64.722,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking bigger risks.",
"char_start": 839,
"char_end": 930,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 64.722,
"end": 67.891,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 931,
"char_end": 974,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 67.891,
"end": 72.976,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 975,
"char_end": 1044,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 72.976,
"end": 75.221,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1062,
"char_end": 1095,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 75.221,
"end": 78.622,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1096,
"char_end": 1146,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 78.622,
"end": 79.229,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1162,
"char_end": 1172,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 79.229,
"end": 85.113,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a minor suspension adjustment.",
"char_start": 1173,
"char_end": 1270,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 85.113,
"end": 90.572,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Understanding the setup is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1271,
"char_end": 1361,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 90.572,
"end": 91.999,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1379,
"char_end": 1397,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 91.999,
"end": 95.961,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1398,
"char_end": 1448,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 95.961,
"end": 103.71,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1464,
"char_end": 1579,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 103.71,
"end": 106.54,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1580,
"char_end": 1622,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 106.54,
"end": 112.066,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up rebuilding everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1623,
"char_end": 1705,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 112.066,
"end": 114.445,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 1723,
"char_end": 1750,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 114.445,
"end": 119.508,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1766,
"char_end": 1842,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 119.508,
"end": 124.238,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1843,
"char_end": 1914,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 124.238,
"end": 127.139,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What heuristic do you always go back to?",
"char_start": 1932,
"char_end": 1972,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 127.139,
"end": 130.476,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1973,
"char_end": 2019,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 130.476,
"end": 131.741,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2035,
"char_end": 2055,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 131.741,
"end": 139.839,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections can change the optimal racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 2056,
"char_end": 2184,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 139.839,
"end": 144.015,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 2185,
"char_end": 2251,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 144.015,
"end": 150.566,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we continue, please support the program by visiting the website of our sponsor.",
